OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain, patchy across the east,
OL,6,Fwill clear away southeast this
OL,7,Fmorning. Then becoming drier and much
OL,8,Fbrighter, a few showers in the west
OL,9,Flater on. Fresh to strong west to
OL,10,Fsouthwesterly winds, easing down this
OL,11,Fafternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe east will have a dry
OL,14,Fevening and night, but passing light
OL,15,Fshowers will affect the west. Fresh
OL,16,Fwesterly winds across the north at
OL,17,Ffirst this evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
