OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FSome bright or sunny
OL,6,Fintervals. Scattered showers across
OL,7,Fthe west but drier with fewer showers
OL,8,Fin the east. Colder than of late.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,11,Fintervals and scattered showers on
OL,12,FWednesday. Dry and bright on Thursday
OL,13,Fbefore rain east later. Early rain on
OL,14,FFriday followed by showers, mainly in
OL,15,Fwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
